{"id":"n37206-1-9","stage":4,"title":"금세 · 马上","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n37206-1-9-1","ko":"아프다던데 이제는 좀 괜찮아졌어요?","zh":"听说你之前生病了，现在好点了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아프다던데","meaning":"疼， 痛，不舒服","explanation":"아프다：疼， 痛，不舒服；다던데：回顾听来的内容，作为后文的背景、对照或判断依据。","readings":[{"term":"아프다","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62239","senseId":"1","lemma":"아프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아프다던데","audio":"/audio/979fb16d9077c7126639.mp3"}},{"text":"이제는","meaning":"现在","explanation":"이제：现在；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58621","senseId":"1","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이제는","audio":"/audio/f91d8bba6ccbcd8c5247.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一点点，有一点","explanation":"좀：一点点，有一点。","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"1","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"괜찮아졌어요?","meaning":"无恙，没事；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"괜찮다：无恙，没事；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"괜찮다","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60097","senseId":"2","lemma":"괜찮다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"괜찮아졌어요","audio":"/audio/379d46e0739ca6f98d14.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"912c6f176a189a34","term":"아프다","zh":"疼， 痛，不舒服","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3","entryId":"62239","definition":"因受伤或生病，而感到痛症或痛苦。","pronunciation":["아프다"]},{"id":"16ebe2403bccd648","term":"이제","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3","entryId":"58621","definition":"说话的同时。","pronunciation":["이제"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一点点，有一点","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"分量或程度稀少地。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"b9a2699f824000e3","term":"괜찮다","zh":"无恙，没事","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3","entryId":"60097","definition":"没有特别的问题。","pronunciation":["괜찬타"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","pronunciation":["지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6690d6fdefaaf877baf4.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n37206-1-9-2","ko":"네. 약을 먹으니 효과가 금세 나타나네요.","zh":"嗯。吃了药，效果很快就显现出来了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"약을","meaning":"药","explanation":"약：药；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"약","audio":"/audio/2a9db5dfd1480367dc36.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72379","senseId":"1","lemma":"약","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"약을","audio":"/audio/f745a64b3ad605aada03.mp3"}},{"text":"먹으니","meaning":"服，吃","explanation":"먹다：服，吃；으니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"3","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹으니","audio":"/audio/27b51cab75cb9eb23f1a.mp3"}},{"text":"효과가","meaning":"效果，功效，效力，成效，作用","explanation":"효과：效果，功效，效力，成效，作用；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"효과","audio":"/audio/377d1a0f2e6c609d9b7b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62405","senseId":"1","lemma":"효과","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"효과가","audio":"/audio/ba4bf4e01d2a198060a1.mp3"}},{"text":"금세","meaning":"马上，立马，立刻","explanation":"금세：马上，立马，立刻。","readings":[{"term":"금세","audio":"/audio/fb465f58ee09787d0a63.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37206","senseId":"1","lemma":"금세","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"금세","audio":"/audio/fb465f58ee09787d0a63.mp3"}},{"text":"나타나네요.","meaning":"显示，展现","explanation":"나타나다：显示，展现；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"나타나다","audio":"/audio/d6fb8e71960ac8027a14.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62286","senseId":"2","lemma":"나타나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나타나네요","audio":"/audio/8c97d746e6a0cdbc792d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"2a9db5dfd1480367","term":"약","zh":"药","audio":"/audio/2a9db5dfd1480367dc36.mp3","entryId":"72379","definition":"为了治疗、预防病患或伤口，服用、抹、注射的物质。","pronunciation":["약"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"服，吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将药物放进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]},{"id":"377d1a0f2e6c609d","term":"효과","zh":"效果，功效，效力，成效，作用","audio":"/audio/377d1a0f2e6c609d9b7b.mp3","entryId":"62405","definition":"做某事所获得的好的结果。","pronunciation":["효ː과","효ː꽈"]},{"id":"fb465f58ee09787d","term":"금세","zh":"马上，立马，立刻","audio":"/audio/fb465f58ee09787d0a63.mp3","entryId":"37206","definition":"时间过不了多久。","pronunciation":["금세"]},{"id":"d6fb8e71960ac802","term":"나타나다","zh":"显示，展现","audio":"/audio/d6fb8e71960ac8027a14.mp3","entryId":"62286","definition":"要发生某事的征兆或某事的结果显露于外。","pronunciation":["나타나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1797157c3606f0393ae6.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.622,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=37206","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":127,"sequenceScore":2.3473,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"option